<%# One block of a cached level (BlocksHelper#render_blocks), drawn by its type's partial; the blocks inside a section or a column are cached in turn. The dependency below puts every partial of this folder into this one's digest, which every block fragment's key holds: a changed partial, or a new type's, is a new key. The first section of a document is handed on as such (first), and its key says so. -%>
<%# Template Dependency: blocks/* -%>
<%= render(partial: "blocks/#{block['type']}", locals: { block: block, media: media, content: content, cached: true, first: local_assigns[:first] }) -%>
